    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      Sleepwear for children includes pajamas, nightgowns, and sleeping bags designed specifically for safe and comfortable sleep. Baby sleeping bags replace loose blankets, eliminating suffocation risks while providing warmth. Pajamas feature flame-retardant fabrics meeting safety standards for sleepwear. Sleepwear prioritizes comfort with soft fabrics, tagless labels, and flat seams to prevent irritation during sleep. Two-piece pajamas offer mix-and-match versatility, while one-piece options provide warmth and simplicity. Sleepwear designs balance safety regulations with comfort and style, ensuring children sleep safely while feeling cozy.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:400;color:#e00;margin-bottom:1rem;">School Uniforms</h3>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;">
      School uniforms require specific construction to meet durability and appearance standards throughout the school year. We manufacture polos, button-down shirts, blouses, skirts, trousers, shorts, and dresses following school uniform specifications. Features include reinforced stress points at knees and elbows, stain-resistant treatments, and color-fast fabrics that maintain appearance through repeated washing. School uniform fabrics are chosen for durability and ease of care, typically cotton-polyester blends that resist wrinkling and maintain shape. Proper sizing and consistent fit across the uniform line are essential for parent satisfaction and school compliance.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

